  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:290px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-darkblue pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Energetic Ionization</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/2/27/Alexander_Summers_-_Havok_wave.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20120610115026\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Alexander Summers - Havok wave\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/2/27/Alexander_Summers_-_Havok_wave.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/315?cb=20120610115026\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/2/27/Alexander_Summers_-_Havok_wave.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/315?cb=20120610115026 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/2/27/Alexander_Summers_-_Havok_wave.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20120610115026 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Alexander Summers - Havok wave\" width=\"270\" height=\"428\" data-image-key=\"Alexander_Summers_-_Havok_wave.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Alexander Summers - Havok wave.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Havok (Marvel Comics) absorbs cosmic energy and converts it to plasma energy blasts.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb energy and convert to ionization</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>absorb energy and convert it towards ionization</b>. Combination of <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">Energy Absorption</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Plasma_Manipulation\" title=\"Plasma Manipulation\">Plasma Manipulation</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Techniques\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Techniques</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Variations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Variations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergetic_Ionization%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Ionic Capacitance</li>\n<li>Transduction Ionization</li>\n<li>Ionization Potential</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergetic_Ionization%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb energy and convert it towards a self-ionization process. They are capable of creating ions as well as plasma from themselves and around them without issue. They are also capable of manipulating personal ionic forces. Unlike <a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Ionization\" title=\"Personal Ionization\">Personal Ionization</a>, this power relies on external forces for their plasmatic abilities.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergetic_Ionization%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Ionization\" title=\"Bio-Ionization\">Bio-Ionization</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Electromagnetic_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Electromagnetic Manipulation\">Bio-Electromagnetic Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Photoionization\" title=\"Bio-Photoionization\">Bio-Photoionization</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Spectrum_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Spectrum Manipulation\">Bio-Spectrum Manipulation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Volatility_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Volatility Manipulation\">Bio-Volatility Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Equivalence_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Equivalence Manipulation\">Bio-Equivalence Manipulation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Heat_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Heat Manipulation\">Bio-Heat Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Thermal_Ionization\" title=\"Bio-Thermal Ionization\">Bio-Thermal Ionization</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Fire_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Fire Manipulation\">Bio-Fire Manipulation</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Ionic_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Ionic Manipulation\">Bio-Ionic Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Plasma_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Plasma Manipulation\">Bio-Plasma Manipulation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Radiation_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Radiation Manipulation\">Bio-Radiation Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Cosmic_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Cosmic Manipulation\">Bio-Cosmic Manipulation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Ionic_Manipulation\" title=\"Ionic Manipulation\">Ionic Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Deionization\" title=\"Deionization\">Deionization</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Plasma_Manipulation\" title=\"Plasma Manipulation\">Plasma Manipulation</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Conversion\" title=\"Energy Conversion\">Energy Conversion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Ionic_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Ionic Dynamo\">Bio-Ionic Dynamo</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Electromagnetic_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Electromagnetic Dynamo\">Bio-Electromagnetic Dynamo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Plasma_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Plasma Dynamo\">Bio-Plasma Dynamo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Volatile_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Volatile Dynamo\">Bio-Volatile Dynamo</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energetic_Equivalence\" title=\"Energetic Equivalence\">Energetic Equivalence</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energetic_Reactor\" title=\"Energetic Reactor\">Energetic Reactor</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energetic_Heating\" title=\"Energetic Heating\">Energetic Heating</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Ionic_Furnace\" title=\"Bio-Ionic Furnace\">Bio-Ionic Furnace</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energetic_Combustion\" title=\"Energetic Combustion\">Energetic Combustion</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energetic_Radiation\" title=\"Energetic Radiation\">Energetic Radiation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Cosmic_Transformer\" title=\"Bio-Cosmic Transformer\">Bio-Cosmic Transformer</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energized_Body\" title=\"Energized Body\">Energized Body</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">Energy Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Detection\" title=\"Energy Detection\">Energy Detection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Energy\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Personal Energy\">Personal Energy</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Ionization\" title=\"Personal Ionization\">Personal Ionization</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Electromagnetism\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Personal Electromagnetism\">Personal Electromagnetism</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Electricity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Personal Electricity\">Personal Electricity</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Static\" title=\"Personal Static\">Personal Static</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Thermal_Radiation\" title=\"Personal Thermal Radiation\">Personal Thermal Radiation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Equivalence\" title=\"Personal Equivalence\">Personal Equivalence</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Nuclear_Power\" title=\"Personal Nuclear Power\">Personal Nuclear Power</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Self_Combustion\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Self Combustion\">Self Combustion</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Heat\" title=\"Personal Heat\">Personal Heat</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Entropy\" title=\"Personal Entropy\">Personal Entropy</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Kinetic_Energy\" title=\"Personal Kinetic Energy\">Personal Kinetic Energy</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Radiation\" title=\"Personal Radiation\">Personal Radiation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Cosmic_Energy\" title=\"Personal Cosmic Energy\">Personal Cosmic Energy</a></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Techniques\">Techniques</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergetic_Ioniza